@startuml
title Green Rides State Machine Diagram

[*] --> Login

state Login
Login : entry / user should be registered
Login : do / user provide Login Details
Login : exit / login Successful

state JourneyDetails
JourneyDetails : entry / after successful login and destination selection
JourneyDetails : do / display journey details
JourneyDetails : choice / activate driving mode or choose other options
JourneyDetails --> DrivingMode
JourneyDetails --> OtherOptions

state DrivingMode
DrivingMode : entry / user chooses driving mode
DrivingMode : do / enable driving mode

state OtherOptions
OtherOptions : entry / user chooses other options
OtherOptions : do / allow user to select a place to eat, view its menu, and place an order if they are hungry
OtherOptions --> EatOut

state EatOut
EatOut : entry / user chooses to eat out
EatOut : do / inform relevant authorities in case of accident
EatOut : do / send notifications during driving or in case of an accident
EatOut : do / allow users to provide feedback upon completion of their journey

@enduml
